The playground's drawing reader (playground/reader-weights.js) holds weights
trained on UJI Pen Characters (Version 2): F. Prat, M. J. Castro, D. Llorens,
A. Marzal and J. M. Vilar, 2008, UCI Machine Learning Repository,
doi:10.24432/C5FG8S, licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data itself is not
distributed with this repository.

Every dataset this repository uses, with its licence, is listed in
docs/datasets.md.

The SIP research schema and aggregate reports under results/sip/ derive from:
Linda Greta Dui, Simone Toffoli, Stefania Fontolan, Chiara Piazzalunga,
Cristiano Termine and Simona Ferrante, dataset for "Quantitative analysis of
handwriting kinematics in primary and lower secondary school children through
a sensorized ink pen: a cross-sectional population-based study", v1,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19485897, CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: aggregate audits and independent logistic/dummy baseline reports;
original participant tables are downloaded locally and are not distributed.
